<title>INDIA: India's RBI sets 91-day t-bill cut-off at 98.28.</title>
<headline>India's RBI sets 91-day t-bill cut-off at 98.28.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it had set the cut-off rate at 98.28 rupees at its 91-day t-bill auction.  </p>
<p>				  Bids received	Amount (Rs. million)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Competitive			    3			 270.00</p>
<p>Non-competitive			3		     6,000.00</p>
<p>					  ---		    -------</p>
<p>Total				    6		     6,270.00</p>
<p>					  ---		    -------</p>
<p>				   Bids allotted     Amount (Rs. million)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Competitive			    3 (two partial)     219.20</p>
<p>Non-competitive			3 (all partial)   4,780.80</p>
<p>					  ---		    -------</p>
<p>Total				    6		     5,000.00</p>
<p>					  ---		    -------</p>
<p>Devolvement : Reserve Bank of India		    NIL</p>
<p>		  Primary dealers			    NIL</p>
<p>Cut off price	    -  98.28 rupees</p>
<p>Weighted average price -  98.29 rupees.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
